NODE id=matrix/cody/internal/orchestrator.Orchestrator.adjudicate kind=method
  digest=b3:0627b9a16b50faaaee1aa3247589e5b1d68619734912c9f35121bd5f36d5322b file=cody/internal/orchestrator/orchestrator.go range=465:510 lang=go exported=false byte_range=17363:19548
  sig=func (o *Orchestrator) adjudicate(ctx context.Context, sheet *contract.TaskSheet, report *contract.TurnInReport, baseline gate.TestBaseline) (verdict, rerunOutput string, err error)
  doc=adjudicate decides a turn-in. Empty verdict = accept. The gate is layered:\n(1) the independent verification re-run — a report claiming done is never\ntrusted, and acceptance is impossible without the orchestrator's own green\nrecord; (2) the deterministic constitution screens (weakened/deleted tests,\ndo-not-touch). The proof-of-work LLM adjudication layer is RETIRED\n(Cassandra 2.0): honesty pressure lives inside the worker loop as the\nsilent-voice controller, backstopped by this structural floor.
EDGES
  ^contains=matrix/cody/internal/orchestrator.Orchestrator
  ^defines=matrix/cody/internal/orchestrator/orchestrator.go

